  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Jae-Hyeong and Min have been friends and rivals in judo since childhood. Min always believed they would continue their journey in the sport together, but one day, Jae-Hyeong suddenly disappears without a word. Years later, Min enrolls at Jae-Hyeong’s university and tracks him down, only to discover that Jae-Hyeong has quit judo entirely. Determined to bring him back, Min challenges Jae-Hyeong to one final match—but the stakes are anything but ordinary. A tense and emotional story of friendship, rivalry, and unresolved feelings unfolds...\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Chapter count includes five side story episodes.*",
